English:
- Security was called for first aid support;
- first aid scaled up to ambulance deployment. IP was transported to hospital;
- Incident investigation started (golden hour);
- work stopped and work site cleaned up and closed.
- Outage safety stand-down

Work Area Changes;
Scaffold modified to remove scaffold clip from work area. Protective caps fitted to other protruding scaffold clip clamping screws.
IP injury cleaned and dressed by Siemens First Aider, to remove potential infection and dressed to prevent further infection. The wound will be redressed at the end of the working shift. The IP returned to normal working duties after First Aid treatment. Area inspected, photographed and IP interview conducted.
